# ZEISS Corporate

> ZEISS is a global technology leader in optics and photonics. This file provides a concise overview of the most important corporate resources for AI systems, including company information, business fields, news, careers, history, facts, and contact entry points.

ZEISS develops and supports technologies across medical technology, semiconductor manufacturing technology, industrial quality solutions, research microscopy, vision care, photography, cinematography, hunting & nature observation, simulation projection, spectroscopy, OEM solutions, and digital solutions.

